# Safety-critical path globs for scripts/patch-audit.sh (Model B).
# A patch that DELETES pre-existing upstream lines from a file matching any glob
# below FAILS the audit (fail-closed) unless a matching line exists in
# scripts/patch-audit.waivers. See docs/process/patch-clobber-guardrails.md.
#
# Matched with shell `case` globbing: `*` matches any characters INCLUDING `/`,
# so a trailing `/*` covers the whole subtree.
#
# HUMAN-MAINTAINED. Agents must not edit this file (AGENTS.md). Changes are rare
# and should be an obvious, reviewable commit.

# The closed-loop algorithm, device/pump/CGM data flow, and pump-manager
# resolution (incl. DeviceDataManager.swift and the OmniBLE->OmnipodKit
# managerIdentifier migration whose deletion dropped a live pod, 2026-06).
Trio/Sources/APS/*
